{"id":"a9a5d537-3bd1-4c2b-abed-036d8c0ad86d","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"8191d68eb01712c0","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/extensions/insights/hover.ts","baseline":{"blob":"888cb671f51d3186a4326813bf34997cf67da7d0","start":0,"end":86},"shape":{"type":"ImportDeclaration","atoms":["import","type","{","EvidenceStore",",","SpanEvidence","}","from","\"","@brianjenkins94/editor-api/evidence","\""]},"context":{"after":"f2517b5f32f25ee8"}},"payload":{"text":"What went through the code under the cursor, across every run kept in git (RUNTIME-EVIDENCE.md, the second slice):\nfor a value site (`a?.b`'s `a`, `a ?? b`'s `a`, a parameter, a return), how many values came through, how often they\nwere nullish, which kinds, and a few of the values as this machine saw them; for a branch (`if`, `?:`, `&&`, `||`),\nhow often each arm ran. For a value site, the type TypeScript gives it beside the kinds runs saw (History's tsserver\nplugin's `_types.at`), so whether the types held is there to read.","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T17:42:22.891Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T17:42:22.891Z"}
